  "name": "Majima's Labor Contract",
  "sortId": 18159,
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Majima%27s_Labor_Contract",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-09-02T11:49:18.990Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "*Labor Contract"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-323aff8c9f12c2ac"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Party A: Majima"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Party B: Shihong"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-715c37de31f47024"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Purpose"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The purpose of this contract is to clarify the rights, obligations, and responsibilities between Parties A & B regarding security works, and to ensure the legal rights of both Parties."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f048a651d5aaad39"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Work"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Party B will be hired as Party A's security personnel, responsible for performing security-related tasks."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Party B must wear the helmet and armor of a Luofu Cloud Knights Officer during work hours to ensure safety and efficiency of work services."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Party B must be physically strong and be able to handle fighting and carrying tasks to ensure an appropriate response to sudden and emergency situations at work."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b295173e6f43bfa5"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Place of Work"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Shifts are set based on Party A's location and must not be called into question."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-eb8f6aa37eca378f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Remuneration and Benefits"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Party B's salary will be paid according to remuneration standards set by Party A."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2b86e6743370235f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "5. Confidentiality Clause"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Party B may encounter third-party interrogation in the line of work, and must keep in strict confidence all work content. Leaking of information to a third party is forbidden."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Upon resignation, Party B must continue to undertake obligation of confidentiality."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Party B will not read the terms and conditions of this contract carefully, and won't even notice this condition."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-80afe086de0c7f9f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "6. Breaching Contract"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. If Party B fails to perform the duties and obligations stipulated in this contract, Party A retains the right to take corrective measures and summarily punish or dismiss Party B."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Party A shall bear no legal ramifications should Party B be arrested for illegal activities."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7a5b1e956e545764"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "7. Termination"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. The contract period is three (3) days only. Party B shall not terminate the contract without authorization."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e0ffae8057afc6b1"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "8. Other Terms"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. This contract is in duplicate, with Parties A & B each retaining one (1) copy both of equal effect."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ae2a640050fdd529"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Decisions should be made in accordance with relevant legislation from the Interastral Peace Corporation®."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-da2a5e073eca061d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "*Party A: Majima"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "*Party B: Shihong"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-bbe922d17ae760a0"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
